{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217650","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217650","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1621765001:1":{"text":"Um... can any of you see Girod? I only see a glowing mirror... Did we get it wrong?","source_cn":"呃……你们看到吉罗德了吗？我只看到了一面发着光的镜子…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEC754D6DA2D25E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621765002:1":{"text":"No way! There's no flaw in our reasoning.","source_cn":"不可能！我们的猜测没有任何逻辑问题，不会出错的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97F5D2B596C4C407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621765003:1":{"text":"Is it possible that Girod has merged with the mirror? Maybe that's why we can't see him.","source_cn":"难道说，吉罗德被关在镜子太久，已经完全融入进镜子里了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05C673646115AA5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621765004:1":{"text":"Huh? Looks like only ghosts can help us find him!","source_cn":"那怎么办？要从镜子里找一个看不见的东西，鬼才能找到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x465536B607816F98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1621765004":{"text":"Huh? Looks like only ghosts can help us find him!","source_cn":"那怎么办？要从镜子里找一个看不见的东西，鬼才能找到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46553